     A* Project:     Project #5 - Student Population Summary Report
     A* File:        PRJ5PRTF.PRTF
     A* Programmer:  Chris Grimm
     A* Date:        10/09/2020
     A*
     A* Description:
     A*   External printer file definition for the Wibaux University
     A*   Student Population Summary Report. Defines report headers,
     A*   residency classification column headings, and summary totals
     A*   matrix by class level (Freshman, Sophomore, Junior, Senior)
     A*   and district status (In-District, Out-of-District, International).
     A*
     A* Used By:     PROJECT5.RPGLE
     A*=======================================================================
     A
     A          R HEADING
     A                                     1DATE(*SYS *YY)
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                    33'Wibaux University'
     A                                    72'Page'
     A                                    80PAGNBR
     A                                      EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                    25'Student Population Summary Report'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                    33'Student Residency'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                     6'Classification'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                    23'In-District'
     A                                    37'Out-Of-District'
     A                                    54'International'
     A                                    70'Total'
     A          R TOTAL                     SPACEB(1)
     A                                     8'Freshman'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            IFRESHTOT      4  0     26EDTCDE(1)
     A            OFRESHTOT      4  0     42EDTCDE(1)
     A            INFRESHTOT     4  0     59EDTCDE(1)
     A            TOTFRESH       5  0     70EDTCDE(1)
     A                                     8'Sophomores'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            ISOPHTOT       4  0     26EDTCDE(1)
     A            OSOPHTOT       4  0     42EDTCDE(1)
     A            INSOPHTOT      4  0     59EDTCDE(1)
     A            TOTSOPH        5  0     70EDTCDE(1)
     A                                     8'Juniors'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            IJUNTOT        4  0     26EDTCDE(1)
     A            OJUNTOT        4  0     42EDTCDE(1)
     A            INJUNTOT       4  0     59EDTCDE(1)
     A            TOTJUN         5  0     70EDTCDE(1)
     A                                     8'Seniors'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            ISENTOT        4  0     26EDTCDE(1)
     A            OSENTOT        4  0     42EDTCDE(1)
     A            INSENTOT       4  0     59EDTCDE(1)
     A            TOTSEN         5  0     70EDTCDE(1)
     A                                     8'Total'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            IDISTOT        5  0     25EDTCDE(1)
     A            ODISTOT        5  0     41EDTCDE(1)
